Deviation from ARCHITECTURE.md §3.5's single-file sketch (fullcalendar.min.js
only): v6 ships locale data as a separate file from the core bundle, so a
second vendored file is required for Thai month names / button text. No CDN
used at runtime by either file. Note: the th locale's own `week.dow` is 1
(Monday) — consistent with, but not a substitute for, the explicit
`firstDay: 1` set in calendar.js (ARCHITECTURE Decision 1b requires the
explicit setting regardless of what a locale's default happens to be).

Provenance: both hashes recomputed locally (`shasum -a 256`) against the
files vendored into this directory and confirmed to match upstream jsdelivr
6.1.15 exactly (2026-07-25 security review). Nothing in the repo verifies
this automatically — a future version bump must recompute and update both
lines here by hand.
